  "application_type_full": "Tree works: Trees in conservation areas/subject to TPOs",
  "description": "Sycamore (T1) - Crown reduce by 1.5 metres in height and spread on all aspects, leaving a finished height of 13 metres in height and 6 metres in spread on all aspects. Crown lift to 3.5 metres above ground level. Pruning cuts to be made back to suitable branch junctions and cuts to be no larger than one third of the parent branch diameter. Development works will begin on the site soon and as such, crown reduction works will maintain the tree at a more suitable size for the development. The tree is also located within a few metres of Ebury Bridge Road and therefore works will maintain the tree in correct proportions, so as not to encroach on the pavement/road.",
